		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  Gros bug de Postgresql]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=25443#p25443"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>voici la définition de la fonction :</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>create or replace function sync.insert_handler(
         schema_name    varchar
        ,r              public.audit_history
) returns void as $$</code></pre></div><p>et son appel :</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>declare
        r               public.audit_history;
...
case r.operation

                        when &#039;INSERT&#039; then perform sync.insert_handler(sync_schema_name, r);</code></pre></div><p>Où ai-je pêché ?</p>]]></content>
